BN-600|thermal_power_mwth|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"GEN-IV Int'l Forum webinar ""BN-600 and BN-800 Operating Experience"" (Pakhomov, IPPE, 2018) - ""thermal power of 1470 thermal megawatts"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|fuel_type|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"Same IPPE webinar - references ""uranium oxide burnup design level"" fuel program"|specs_08.psv
BN-600|coolant|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"Same IPPE webinar - sodium fast reactor, ""sodium temperature in the outlet from the core"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|number_of_coolant_loops|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"Same IPPE webinar - ""three circuits: primary, secondary and tertiary circuits, and the three loops for each circuit"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|enrichment_pct|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Wikipedia: BN-600 reactor - ""enriched to between 17-26% 235U"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|core_height_m|WRONG|1.03|MED|"Wikipedia: BN-600 reactor - core height listed as ""1.03 metres (3 ft 5 in)"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|core_diameter_m|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Wikipedia: BN-600 reactor - core diameter listed as ""2.05 metres (6 ft 9 in)"", consistent with DB value within rounding"|specs_08.psv
BN-600|number_of_fuel_assemblies|WRONG|369|MED|"Wikipedia: BN-600 reactor - ""369 fuel assemblies, mounted vertically"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|number_of_control_elements|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Wikipedia: BN-600 reactor - ""27 reactivity control elements including 19 shimming rods, two automatic control rods, and six automatic emergency shut-down rods"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|outlet_temperature_c|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"GEN-IV/IPPE webinar - ""sodium temperature in the outlet from the core is 550-degree Celsius""; Wikipedia lists max operating temp 550C"|specs_08.psv
BN-600|inlet_temperature_c|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|Searched IPPE webinar and Wikipedia BN-600 extract; neither retrieved source stated a core inlet temperature value|specs_08.psv
BN-600|number_of_steam_generators|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|GEN-IV/IPPE webinar - three loops, each with its own steam generator (8 sections/3 modules each = 24 modules total, one steam generator per loop)|specs_08.psv
BN-600|fuel_assembly_type|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|No retrieved source this session confirmed hexagonal geometry for BN-600 fuel assemblies|specs_08.psv
BN-600|average_burnup_mwd_per_t|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|Retrieved sources (IPPE webinar, HandWiki mirror) state burnup only in % heavy atoms (11.1-11.8%), no MWd/t figure found|specs_08.psv
BN-600|number_of_turbines|WRONG|3|MED|"WebSearch result summarizing IAEA ARIS/INIS BN-600 technical data - ""three turbines of the K-200-12.8-3 type and three electric generators of the TGV-200M type"""|specs_08.psv
BN-600|turbine_speed_rpm|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|No retrieved source this session stated an explicit rpm figure for BN-600 turbines|specs_08.psv
BN-600|low_pressure_sections|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|No retrieved source this session addressed number of low-pressure turbine sections|specs_08.psv
BN-600|live_steam_pressure_bar|CONFIRMED|None|MED|WebSearch result citing turbine model designation K-200-12.8-3 (12.8 MPa = ~128 bar), consistent with DB value of 130 bar within rounding|specs_08.psv
BN-800|thermal_power_mwth|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"GEN-IV Int'l Forum webinar ""BN-600 and BN-800 Operating Experience"" (Pakhomov, IPPE, 2018) - ""reactor thermal power is 2100"""|specs_08.psv
BN-800|fuel_type|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Same IPPE webinar - ""currently a hybrid core is used in the BN-800 reactor. It includes both MOX-fuel and uranium dioxide-fuel"""|specs_08.psv
BN-800|coolant|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|Same IPPE webinar - sodium fast reactor|specs_08.psv
BN-800|number_of_coolant_loops|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"Same IPPE webinar - ""we have 3 circulation pumps and 3 loops"""|specs_08.psv
BN-800|core_height_m|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Same IPPE webinar - ""core height is less than 1 meter... not as high as BN-600"" (qualitative, consistent with DB's 0.88m)"|specs_08.psv
BN-800|core_diameter_m|CONFIRMED|None|MED|"Same IPPE webinar - ""the diameter of the core is 2.5 meters"""|specs_08.psv
BN-800|number_of_fuel_assemblies|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|IPPE webinar did not state a fuel assembly count|specs_08.psv
BN-800|number_of_control_elements|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|IPPE webinar did not state a control element count|specs_08.psv
BN-800|outlet_temperature_c|CONFIRMED|None|HIGH|"Same IPPE webinar - ""the parameters of the coolant temperature are very close to BN-600, the outlet is 547"""|specs_08.psv
BN-800|inlet_temperature_c|UNVERIFIABLE|None|LOW|IPPE webinar gives only secondary-loop steam generator sodium temps (inlet 505C/outlet 308C), a different measurement point than reactor core inlet; no core inlet figure retrieved|specs_08.psv
